{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100790","id":2251063378,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GLIBS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100790","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100790.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100790.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100790","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100790/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100790/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100790/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e30187d863f12a0d2fe8886bcd82d02859ccc4f9","number":100790,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"LightmapGI: Save directional lightmaps as ldr textures","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Inspired by https://media.contentapi.ea.com/content/dam/eacom/frostbite/files/gdc2018-precomputedgiobalilluminationinfrostbite.pdf\r\n\r\nChanges the way directional lightmap textures are stored: Previously they were part of the HDR lightmap texture array in spite of only storing LDR data. Now, they are saved as a separate .png file and compressed to DXT1/ETC2 RGB on import.\r\n\r\nThis approach reduces the memory footprint by half (when compressed as DXT1/ETC2 RGB). I've tested this with several scenes (many with a solid albedo, to see how the quality will be affected) and the low-quality versions don't look much worse than high-quality (BC7/ASTC 4x4) ones (even with etcpak).\r\n\r\n#108405 will allow scaling them independently from regular lightmaps, making it possible to bake lower-resolution directional maps and save even more video memory.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Test with more scenes,\r\n- [x] Apply the other fixes to directional baking (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96114#discussion_r1745739515),\r\n- [x] Implement an automatic conversion system for older lightmaps","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":